---
import { siteConfig } from '../data/siteConfig';
---

<section id="contacto" class="scroll-mt-20 sm:scroll-mt-24 py-20 sm:py-28 relative bg-[#FAFBF7] border-t border-[#D9DED4]" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-8">
      
      <!-- Eyebrow -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#DCE7D7]/50 border border-[#A8BFA3]/40 text-xs font-mono text-[#263B2B]">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#6F8F72] animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>05 — INICIAR CONVERSACIÓN</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Headline -->
      <h2
        id="contact-heading"
        class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold text-[#182019] tracking-tight leading-[1.08]"
      >
        ¿Tenés una idea?<br />
        <span class="font-serif italic font-normal text-[#263B2B]">
          Hablemos<span class="text-[#6F8F72] not-italic">.</span>
        </span>
      </h2>

      <!-- Subtitle -->
      <p class="text-base sm:text-xl text-[#697069] max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed">
        Contame qué tenés en mente y vemos juntos cómo llevarlo a la web. Sin compromisos, para entender si soy la persona adecuada para tu proyecto.
      </p>

      <!-- Primary Channels Grid -->
      <div class="pt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-left">
        
        <!-- WhatsApp Direct Card -->
        <a
          href={siteConfig.contact.whatsapp}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F4F5ED] border border-[#D9DED4] hover:border-[#6F8F72] hover:bg-[#DCE7D7]/30 transition-all block"
          data-interactive
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6F8F72] font-semibold">Respuesta Rápida</span>
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[#FAFBF7] border border-[#D9DED4] flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-[#182019] group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform">
              ↗
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#182019]">Escribime por WhatsApp</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#697069] mt-1">Para consultas directas, disponibilidad o conversar sobre una idea.</p>
          <div class="mt-4 text-xs font-mono text-[#263B2B] font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span>Iniciar chat</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Email Direct Card -->
        <a
          href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contact.email}`}
          class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F4F5ED] border border-[#D9DED4] hover:border-[#6F8F72] hover:bg-[#DCE7D7]/30 transition-all block"
          data-interactive
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#697069] font-semibold">Correo Electrónico</span>
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[#FAFBF7] border border-[#D9DED4] flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-[#182019] group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform">
              ↗
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#182019]">Enviar un email</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#697069] mt-1">Para briefs detallados, presupuestos o especificaciones de proyecto.</p>
          <div class="mt-4 text-xs font-mono text-[#263B2B] font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5 truncate">
            <span>{siteConfig.contact.email}</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </div>
        </a>

      </div>

      <!-- Secondary Links (Instagram, GitHub) -->
      <div class="pt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6 text-sm text-[#697069]">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">También podés encontrarme en:</span>
        <a
          href={siteConfig.contact.instagram}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="hover:text-[#182019] underline font-medium"
        >
          Instagram ↗
        </a>
        <a
          href={siteConfig.contact.github}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="hover:text-[#182019] underline font-medium"
        >
          GitHub ↗
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
